{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_10_level_main_10-03_end","groupId":"main_10","stageId":"main_10-03","title":"鸣铳示警","storyCode":"10-4","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-03_end.txt","sourceHash":"7624e3e955b3550c4128fe1d14cf419dca28ca7f1b34fe5776b1909797773ce2","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g2_inexport"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！升降梯倒了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再往下一点点，我、我的腿就......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......拉住我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是说拉住我的造物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"笨蛋......你别把我也拽倒了啊！带着你们，我本来就很难浮起来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长、长官......谢谢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下回滚得更机灵些，少给我添乱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长官，小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......是炮弹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，要比一般的榴弹炮厉害得多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......而且，仅仅瞄准了这一小块区域？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曼弗雷德......你是不是早就在看着了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死的心机深沉的魔族佬！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听好了，都给我停止行动！这些萨卡兹没有追的必要了，至于那个司机......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这倒霉地方......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g15_customs"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民？","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"中尉，这、这是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民？","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城防炮怎么会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......伦蒂尼姆的防御墙建成近七十年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是第一次......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"墙上的防御炮，瞄准目标包含了......城内。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g4_giantwall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威力不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只用上了一成火力，就能轻松熔毁普通结构。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这可是伦蒂尼姆的城防武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还只是副炮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的武器专家说，如果我能启动主炮，这些炮能轻松击穿任意一艘高速战舰的装甲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"武器专家......是那位城防军工兵队的军官？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多亏你帮我抓到了他和他的妻女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他还活着？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹还用得上他，他就不会死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炮手，瞄准十一号升降梯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......偏了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜，准度还需要提升。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟这些炮口原本只能对外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对外......在我们进入伦蒂尼姆之前，这些城防炮瞄准的是城外大公爵的军队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当我们假借平息公爵争端的名义入城的时候，它们甚至都没有把我们的人纳入过瞄准范围——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这也算对外吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自从高卢战败、伊比利亚沉寂之后，维多利亚已很久不需要应对实质上的外敌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，所以殿下为我们谋到了这个机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如此精良的武器，本就该发挥更大作用，而不是架在这里，充当点缀门楣的装饰品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炮手，启动活动目标动态追踪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，成功了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给它们调整朝向就耗费了我们整整一个月的时间......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所幸效果基本达标。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"控制住了这批武器，就意味着我们真正控制住了伦蒂尼姆的出入口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我们把所有城防炮都调整好......就再没有人能躲在钢铁高墙的荫蔽之下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g15_customs"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炮火似乎被深池引开了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......一次试验？他们的目的难道仅仅只是验证......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，他们真正的目标并不是这出入口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民？","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"中尉，我们怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......继续往城内方向撤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......萨迪恩区的其他地方也不再安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹对伦蒂尼姆的控制正在收紧。只要城防炮对准城内一天，我们的性命就随时都捏在他们手里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除非......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民？","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您在想什么，中尉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么。走吧，先离开这里再说。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g2_inexport"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这该死的城墙，该死的炮！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长官，您的造物又被击碎了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我根本......来不及！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别愣着了，滚，有多快滚多快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......逼着我们从这里逃跑是吧？曼弗雷德，你今天这么戏耍我，我早晚都......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长官，我刚才看到有个熟悉的人影朝相反方向跑了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个人......褐色头发的鲁珀？是她？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给我拦下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长官，小心！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你犯什么蠢？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长官，我挡着，您快走，快走吧......您还要替领袖......找......找到......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好，好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是第十三个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十三条塔拉人的命。我会替领袖记住，有朝一日，我要亲手、成倍地问萨卡兹讨回来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g4_giantwall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将军，深池的队伍完全被打散了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看见了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们没注意到反抗军......这帮狡猾的虫豸！他们好像就露了一下头，城防炮启动以后，就又不见了踪影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，他们会不会已经被打死了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我就觉得我们的活不至于这么轻松。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那他们是混进逃走的人群里了吗？要不要通知巡逻队，让他们拦住平民，继续搜捕？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"继续炮轰出入口。对了，加大力度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加大火力？出入口已经烂得差不多了，不太可能藏人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们不会再走这条路了。而且，你见过萨卡兹拔刀只拔一半的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然动了手，不如让他们看看清楚，我们能做到什么程度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是故意在他们面前彰显力量。你想......断了他们的后路，逼他们自己走出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这场捉迷藏耗时够久了。即便我还能等，殿下们与诸王庭也都已失去耐心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不论是谁，有所图谋的话，我只想麻烦他们快一点。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g15_customs"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，附近没有一处位置是绝对安全的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算我们全部撤到了这块结构下面，也还是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也还是随时都会被这个炮打穿啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我粗略估计过了，别说我们头顶这块外墙底板，这炮要是火力全开的话，就连正式的移动城市地块也能击穿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推进之王，你们伦蒂尼姆的炮真不是开玩笑啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这也是我第一次见它们大规模启动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们受到的欢迎还挺有规格咯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"规格再提升的话，我们会在距城墙五十公里处灰飞烟灭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊要撑不住了啊——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，我的无人机也加固不了这底板结构了，照这么轰下去，我们早晚一起被炸飞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们必须离开这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"深池士兵也在用最快的速度撤退......但他们用上了法术造物做掩体，还会丢下受伤的士兵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......啊......为什么我们这么倒霉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是我们都会死在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不能丢下这些伦蒂尼姆市民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"侦察小组，你们看到炮手了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们恐怕找不到炮手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伦蒂尼姆的城防炮，与我们面前的高墙，本来就是一体的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也就是说，如果我们没法登上高墙或者进入高墙内部，就不可能停止这场轰炸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"没人能顶着炮轰登墙。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我们找不到进入城墙内部的途径。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"躲在这等死也不是办法！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不然，我出去引开这炮火？以我的本事，至少能坚持个几分钟......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......她一个不行的话，我们一起去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们别添乱了好不好？达格达，你是不是跟因陀罗混久了，脑子里也都只剩下肌肉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是让人出去当诱饵是可行的，哪里轮得到你们俩在这里争？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们拿的防具，最多挨两下正规军的弩箭，这已经是工程部的朋友们努力了几个月的成果了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们这么急着去送死的话，就压根不该跟来伦蒂尼姆！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，我听你的，但我绝对不会让维娜在这里出事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们甚至......连家门都还没进！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你们出去确实没用。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"还没到说这些话的时候。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你是不是有想法了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"无人机。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无人机......哦哦，我懂了......我说嘛，果然是这个逻辑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在说什么啊可露希尔？博士话是少，但你不要说了跟没说一个样子啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉啊，我在想方案呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这防御炮还挺智能的，射程范围这么大，它不可能完全依靠手动瞄准，所以它肯定会以某种方式锁定地面附近的活动目标。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一两个人出去是没办法让炮火从我们头顶移开的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可如果我的无人机全部出动，对瞄准算法来说，威胁性说不定能超过我们小队加上所有平民......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是说不定吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁也没法保证啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔，加固失败，超出无人机承压阈值！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"不出三十秒，这底板一定会塌......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只能试试看了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等博士指示，全员做好撤出准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"五、四、三——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"走！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无人机发射！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家快跑！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......成功了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是这一小会，让我们转移到了没几步远的这地方......这块结构同样支撑不了多久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且没有下一次机会了啊，我的宝贝无人机全被打烂了，就算是我，也没法原地给你们再变一批出来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"往前往后都不算安全，想逃出轰炸区，我们还是要冒很大的险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能有一条让我们绕开这里的路就好了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听说你们在找路？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁在这里？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡特斯小姐，我想和你们谈一谈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但在此之前，你最好让你的手下把武器都从我身上移开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——你是什么人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自我介绍得稍后再说了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"钢爪，砍刀，还有这位......呃，这位手上的锤子？女士，你的武器看起来非常帅，但能不能不要对着我的脑袋？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然的话，你们的这位朋友可能会有生命危险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——博士！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"啊？发生了什么？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"他说的是我？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁都别靠近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要有人走近一步，这位朋友的后脑勺就会原地爆开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿、阿米娅，是无人机......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一架无人机，趁我们大家不注意，偷偷绕了过去，这会就贴在博士后脑勺上啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尖耳朵的女士，你很识货。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"实话说，我对你们真的越来越好奇了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家，放下武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，这才对嘛。不过别忘记撤掉角落里那些弩。我敢打赌，自从我站到你们面前，你们的狙击手就没眨过眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......照他说的做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请你相信我，我们从来不会主动地给任何陌生人造成伤害。但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但凡你敢伤害你面前的人，请同样相信我，我可以不依赖任何武器，现在，立刻，让你永远失去威胁别人的能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔呃......这地方已经够危险了，动手之前我们可能都会被炸死啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，要是不想一起被萨卡兹炸成礼花的话，我们恐怕没时间站在这里互相指脑袋了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，我有个建议，请你们放弃抵抗，跟我走一趟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在到地方之前，你们这位朋友还是借我一用——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不好吧。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我能拒绝吗？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，你暂时没有选择的权利。请乖乖跟我走吧，看不见脸的朋友。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
